I need to make the snapshot function robust: before drawing, ensure the renderer has a non‑zero size. The simplest fix is to check `renderer.domElement.width` and `height`; if either is zero, set a default size (e.g., 1280×720) and update the camera's aspect ratio accordingly. This will guarantee that the drawImage call has a valid source canvas.

